  (text "What this does: Measures air pressure with the Bosch BMP390, one of the two dissimilar pressure sensors.\nConnects to: Its own flight-MCU I2C bus, address 0x76, plus independent switched power. Pressure is not a valid height measurement across the whole space-shot profile."
